  Over to You
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Building desktop applications with web technologies is more practical today than ever before, especially when computationally intensive work is properly isolated from the UI thread.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;If you're interested in exploring a local-first approach to media processing, you can try Formatif for free at &lt;code&gt;formatif.net&lt;/code&gt; — no registration or credit card required.&lt;/p&gt;

